1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
Permission slip:

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:05,500
45 minutes counts.

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:09,000
You don't owe any event
your whole night.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Go. Stay 45 minutes.
Say one hello. Leave.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,000
That's a complete rep. Not a partial one. Complete.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
The dread shrinks when
the commitment does.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Save this for Friday night.
